{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And the booty, remaining of the spoil.</b> That which came to the category of division and to the category of assessment-tax, apart from the movable goods and from what was consumed. And Scripture mentions their number, for it was a great number, and we have not heard of booty like it; and likewise it mentions the assessment-tax, for it too was great. And the word מכס is like 'portion,' from the language of (Exodus 12:4): ״תכסו על השה״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:25.041551335Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}